      "summary": "The change adds isolated PDF parsing and exercises the named parsing and limit scenarios. The empty-environment regression test does not verify that clearing inherited variables is necessary.",
      "findingList": [
        {
          "severity": "major",
          "file": "backend/AirlineDemo.Api.Tests/IsolatedPdfParserTests.cs",
          "line": 347,
          "message": "The empty-environment test can pass when environment clearing is removed.",
          "confidence": 0.99,
          "category": "other",
          "evidence": {
            "codePathTraced": "The test sets a sentinel in the parent environment, then checks that CreateStartInfo's Environment collection is empty. ProcessStartInfo's collection is empty by default, even when the child will inherit the parent environment.",
            "failureScenario": "If Environment.Clear() is removed from CreateStartInfo, the test still passes while the worker inherits the sentinel and other parent variables. The test therefore does not fail when the empty-environment behavior required by AC-4 and AC-5 is broken."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
